    "faster I/O",
    "thread safety",
    "lazy evaluation"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "explain": "The context-manager protocol (__enter__/__exit__) guarantees cleanup — files closed, locks released — even when exceptions fly. (Module 1, Concepts.)"
  },
  {
   "id": "il03-dr-duck",
