    "__iter__",
    "__str__",
    "__call__"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "explain": "Dunder methods are the protocols — __len__ is the sized-duck protocol. (Module 1, Concepts: duck typing.)"
  },
  {
   "id": "il03-dr-move",
   "title": "Move semantics",
   "prompt": "`std::move(x)` does what?",
   "choices": [
